DigitalPlatforms SpA (DP) is anItalian industrial group,rapidly growing, operating in the sector ofInternet of Things, Cyber, ICT and AI;
The DP Group is now made up of eight companies / BUs, all based in Italy, with an industrial history of between 20 and 50 years in their sector of expertise. DP primarily addresses critical infrastructure managers inItaly and abroad, in theenergy / utilities, telecommunications, transport and defense sectors.
DP is a full liner player, present in all the elements necessary to createend-to-end IoT solutions, starting from the development, design and production of sensors and industrial electronics products, passing through command and control systems and technologies, up to IoT platforms, system integration for heterogeneous environments and cybersecurity.

The CIBEC - Centro Interdipartimentale di Ingegneria per i Beni Culturali - Interdepartmental Centre of Engineering for Cultural Heritage is a research unit of the University of Naples Federico II devoted to the protection and retrofit of hystoric and cultural heritage constructions. Its research areas include:

a) History of engineering, architecture and building technologies;
b) Analysis and survey of cultural heritage constructions;
c) Use of innovative technologies in protection and management of cultural heritage sites and constructions;
d) Development of best practices.

The CIBEC is also active in dissemination and educational activities.
